OrionLayer open fix 83 — the gyro destabilizer's spin as a battle event
======================================================================

Work order 213 (Data's decision 2 on 212's P2: the gyro turns the target as the
original does; the number from the source). orion2re on `orionlayer-local`, on
top of open fix 82. Every line under ORION2RE_EXT.

`Gyro_Destablizer_` (cmbtspec.cpp:536-640) spins its target, after the line's
eight turns, `rotations_left` sixteenths of a turn with no wait: 19 draws of
`Random_(13)`, then more while the spin would end 15, 0 or 1 sixteenths round
(:566-575). The count is the engine's random draw and was on no wire. Recorded
before the spin as CEV_GYRO_SPIN (the source, the target, the turns), through
open fix 82's `Combat_Note`.

diff --git a/src/ext/ext_api.h b/src/ext/ext_api.h
